&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited 3D printing with any Formlabs material on any Formlabs printer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An equity program that will let you build wealth through RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare coverage (medical, dental, vision) that includes a totally free employee-only plan, effective starting on your first day on the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401K matching with no vesting or tenure requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental leave (fully paid up to 16 weeks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off so you can take time when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Six-week fully paid sabbatical after hitting tenure milestones (with the option to take an additional six weeks after that)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free on-site parking &amp;amp; pre-tax commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
