&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Event Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; is based at our largest European office, in Budapest. This role works closely with Sales, Marketing, Product, Design and Leadership to shape how Formlabs shows up on some of our most important stages.&lt;/p&gt;
