&lt;li&gt;You are energized by travel and willing to be on the road 80%+ of the time. We pay for your time spent traveling, and this position is eligible for overtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong technical background (electromechanical/hardware) &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; the soft skills required to teach others how to use that technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;English and Italian (C1-C2)&lt;/strong&gt;. You can explain complex technical concepts simply and effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver’s license (B) is required.&lt;/li&gt;
