&lt;p data-start=&quot;271&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;At Formlabs, software isn’t a side dish—it’s core to how we design, manufacture, and deliver world-class 3D printing products. Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://formlabs.com/software/dashboard/&quot;&gt;Dashboard&lt;/a&gt; is the nervous system that connects printers, customers, data, and teams. We’re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;506&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;Lead Full Stack Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help own and evolve this platform from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;593&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot;&gt;This is a high-ownership, high-impact role where you’ll shape architecture, ship meaningful features, and help define best practices as we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
