&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Be a foundational engineer for the Dashboard and its backend infrastructure, influencing long-term technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design, build, and scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;969&quot;&gt;reliable, high-performance web applications&lt;/strong&gt; using Python and Django at the core.&lt;/li&gt;
