&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Identify immediate upcoming user needs, then work with the team to develop product requirements and a product roadmap that addresses them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using these factors, define a strong product vision, build a product roadmap and create a business case to pitch to the leadership team of Formlabs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define key product metrics to track progress towards this vision, and deliver results on these metrics&lt;/li&gt;
