&lt;li&gt;Ensure product improvements get shipped to customers as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work seamlessly across technical, business, and design teams to guide well designed, well-built features that impact the business over the finish line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This person will serve as the voice of the customer, working to develop and launch products that will delight our members and support business goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
