&lt;p&gt;Wherever you land, you&#39;ll run the work you own like a mini-CEO and build the manufacturing, supply chain, and fulfillment that let Formlabs products scale globally. We value &lt;strong&gt;bias for action, comfort with ambiguity, and deep ownership&lt;/strong&gt; over outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking &lt;strong&gt;results-focused leaders/entrepreneurs&lt;/strong&gt; who can quickly pivot and take charge.&lt;/p&gt;
