&lt;li&gt;Serve as a visible brand ambassador, building relationships with customers, partners, and prospects onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyze event performance insights, using learnings to continuously improve formats, messaging, and attendee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Sales, Product, Design, and Marketing teams, providing recommendations and influencing decisions to maximize event impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for ordering and tracking event inventory including collateral, giveaways, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel as needed (~25% of the time) to attend events, oversee execution, and support onsite teams - mostly within Europe&lt;/li&gt;
