&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Global Amazon Marketplace&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be the global owner of our Amazon channel and its P&amp;amp;L. You&#39;ll define the strategy — what we sell, where, and how — across catalog, content, advertising, pricing, and inventory, and turn Amazon into a scalable, profitable growth engine for both our professional and prosumer product lines. This is a senior, high-ownership individual-contributor role: you&#39;ll set the multi-year roadmap, make the build-vs-partner and 1P-vs-3P calls, represent the channel to marketing and commercial leadership, and manage the agency and tooling relationships needed to scale. You&#39;ll navigate the realities of selling a premium, considered-purchase hardware product on a velocity-driven marketplace, across a dozen-plus geographies, currencies, and regulatory environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global Amazon P&amp;amp;L across all active marketplaces (US, CA, MX, UK, DE, FR, IT, ES, NL, JP, AU, and expansion markets), including revenue, margin, and growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the multi-year marketplace strategy and roadmap: which SKUs and product lines to list in which geos, when and how to enter new marketplaces, and Seller vs. Vendor Central approach per region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full catalog and listing experience — titles, A+ / Enhanced Brand Content, Brand Store, imagery, variations, and localization — directing our creative and product marketing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage the Amazon Advertising strategy (Sponsored Products, Brands, Display, DSP) to hit efficiency and growth goals, integrated with the broader paid media plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pricing, promotions, and deal calendars (Prime Day, seasonal events) in a way that protects brand equity and channel health across our DTC, B2B, and reseller ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with operations and supply chain on FBA/FBM strategy, inventory forecasting, cross-border fulfillment, and account health across geos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement framework for the channel and report performance, risks, and recommendations directly to marketing and commercial leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional programs across ecommerce, lifecycle, creative, product, legal, and regional sales to launch new products on Amazon and keep the experience consistent with formlabs.com.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global Amazon account integrity and compliance — Brand Registry, IP/counterfeit enforcement, and marketplace policy across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage the operating model for the channel — agency partners, tooling, and cross-functional workflows — scaling through influence and partnership rather than headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
