&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;**This hybrid role has a 3-day weekly on-site expectation in our Budapest office.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Formlabs&lt;/strong&gt;, we’re building the tools that make it possible for anyone to bring their ideas to life, from cutting-edge products to life-saving medical devices. Our 3D printing technology powers innovation at more than 50,000 industry leaders worldwide, including &lt;strong&gt;Apple, Google, Tesla, New Balance, and NASA.&lt;/strong&gt; Together, we’re helping everyone design, prototype, and manufacture faster than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated &lt;strong&gt;Social Media &amp;amp; Community Operations Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Budapest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for a&lt;strong&gt; data-driven technical storyteller and community architect&lt;/strong&gt;—someone who thrives on the intersection of creative marketing and technology. You will be the bridge between Formlabs’ industry-leading innovation and our global online community, driving our affiliate program, social media operations, and scaling our presence across specialized professional forums.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Social Media &amp;amp; Content Operations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with our social media and video content creators to develop editorial calendars that translate complex 3D printing workflows into high-quality, on-brand content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMM System Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the day-to-day operations in our Social Media Management tool. You will be responsible for the technical setup, tagging, and organization of outgoing content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the administrative side of social media, including link tracking (UTMs), asset organization, and ensuring all posts adhere to brand and technical standards before going live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Community, Forum &amp;amp; Influencer Advocacy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Forum Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively grow Formlabs’ presence on Reddit and other specialized industry forums. You will monitor discussions and contribute technical insights to establish Formlabs as a helpful, authoritative voice in the community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp;amp; AEO Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Strategically structure forum contributions to enhance SEO &amp;amp; AEO, ensuring Formlabs’ solutions are the top-cited results in both traditional search and AI-driven answer engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influencer Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the expansion of the Formlabs influencer network by identifying, sourcing, and onboarding high-profile technical content creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Affiliate Program Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and scale the Formlabs affiliate program by growing our publisher network and driving high-intent traffic via strategic affiliate link placement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Maximize the full potential of our automated affiliate platform. You will leverage its advanced features—such as automated workflows, performance tracking, and tiered incentives—to scale the program efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the entire affiliate journey, from initial onboarding to ongoing performance optimization. Use data-driven insights to help affiliates succeed and maximize their impact on Formlabs’ growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience in social media operations, community management, or affiliate marketing within a technical or engineering-driven field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;A sound, technical understanding of digital fabrication and a genuine passion for 3D printing technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; In-depth knowledge of the technical social media and forum landscape and best practices across Instagram, X, TikTok, Facebook and Reddit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of SEO and AEO principles, specifically how to structure forum contributions and social content to improve discoverability in a modern search landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of community management and affiliate marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience analyzing social media and community data to meet strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills in English. Additional EMEA language skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;Application Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit an English CV and a tailored, high-quality cover letter that clearly demonstrates your fit for the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunch at the office 3 days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Private health insurance with Medicover (Blue package + hospital coverage)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
