&lt;li&gt;Create robust backend code using Python/Django, and user-facing frontend code with Next.js and React.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with factory operators, product managers, and leadership to define and deliver new features and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of your projects, from initial scoping and development to testing, implementation, and ongoing support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve our existing codebase, ensuring reliability and scalability in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record as a Full-stack Web Developer with experience in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an entrepreneurial and flexible problem-solver, comfortable navigating ambiguity and thriving in a fast-paced, agile development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work autonomously, moving quickly from idea to implementation, and aren’t afraid to experiment, iterate, and refine solutions based on what you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy taking ownership of projects and seeing them through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess strong collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to work on-site in Billerica, MA as needed to test, debug, and release factory software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
