&lt;li&gt;An equity program that will let you build wealth through RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare coverage (medical, dental, vision) that includes a totally free employee-only plan, effective starting on your first day on the job&lt;/li&gt;
