&lt;p&gt;Do you want to change how the world creates?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Formlabs, we’re building the tools that make it possible for anyone to bring their ideas to life, from cutting-edge products to life-saving medical devices. Our 3D printing technology powers innovation at more than 50,000 industry leaders worldwide, including Apple, Google, Tesla, New Balance, and NASA. Together, we’re helping everyone design, prototype, and manufacture faster than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of hands-on builders, engineers, and innovators reinventing how the world makes physical things. If you’re ready to shape the future of fabrication, come build it with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Website Content Operations Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll build the web pages that show the world what 3D printing can do – pages that look good, convert, and drive organic traffic, demand, and sales. If you want to take on new marketing challenges and learn from people who do this well, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize pages and templates in our custom Django CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product, creative, and web teams to deliver high-quality content across our global website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage localized content and publish English and localized pages, assets, and landing pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA web content to make sure pages work as intended&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project-manage web initiatives when needed and deliver them on time and to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document processes with the Web team, and train colleagues to build pages, publish blog posts, and use web apps on their own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use analytics and A/B tests to improve page performance and conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, localize, and QA email campaigns in our email platform, Klaviyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years in a marketing, content, SEO, or growth role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building and managing websites in a CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written English. Other languages are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of content and SEO best practices, and an appetite to learn and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Marketing, Business, Engineering, Journalism, Communications, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and detail-oriented, with strong planning skills in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical, proactive, and goal-driven. Comfortable working independently and across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Ahrefs, Google Analytics, Search Console, YouTube Studio, Screaming Frog or Klaviyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and analyzing A/B tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figma, photo, or video production experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with 3D printing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunch at the office 3 days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Private health insurance with Medicare (Blue package + hospital coverage)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A monthly or quarterly public transportation pass for Budapest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
